:2324,"speakerName":"古剣の銘文","textMapHash":1773376914,"text":"「…剣を手に長歌を詠みて去り、龍を斬りて血をすすり戻る。神光は閃光のごとく、冴える波は山をも砕かんと欲す…」","nextNodeIds":[711090603]},{"nodeId":711090603,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2324,"speakerName":"古剣の銘文","textMapHash":2492679938,"text":"「…天衡の下で虎を斬り、雲海の間で蛟を刺す。功成り衣を払いし後は、永く煙水と同じくして閑なり…」","nextNodeIds":[711090604]},{"nodeId":711090604,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4106788858,"text":"隣にもう一つ石碑があるな…あれ、文字が違うみたいだぞ？","nextNodeIds":[711090605]},{"nodeId":711090605,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2233,"speakerName":"古い模刻","textMapHash":4270718322,"text":"「…魚や羊の馳走をここに残そうとしたが、時間が経てば腐ってしまうだろう。故に作り方をここに書き残し、これを見た者は自ら料理するといい。実に美味なり。」","nextNodeIds":[711090606]},{"nodeId":711090606,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2233,"speakerName":"古い模刻","textMapHash":2120413066,"text":"「…他に何もなく、この剣とこの景色のみ。」","nextNodeIds":[711090607]},{"nodeId":711090607,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2233,"speakerName":"古い模刻","textMapHash":2037877794,"text":"「…九死の境に至る際は、何をすればいいのだろう？知っているはずだ。」","nextNodeIds":[711090608]},{"nodeId":711090608,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2234,"speakerName":"クネクネした模刻","textMapHash":1684973242,"text":"「…遺宝を…取らず、ただ…を一つ残す…これからは…」","nextNodeIds":[711090609]},{"nodeId":711090609,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2234,"speakerName":"クネクネした模刻","textMapHash":2952408442,"text":"「九死の境より逃れるため…今こそ我が…」","nextNodeIds":[711090610]},{"nodeId":711090610,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1337793962,"text":"うぇ…この後に書かれてる字、ぐにゃぐにゃでまったく読めないぞ！","nextNodeIds":[711090611,711090612]},{"nodeId":711090611,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1391046306,"text":"何も取らなかったって意味かも。","nextNodeIds":[711090613]},{"nodeId":711090613,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3083146994,"text":"うぅ、結局価値のあるお宝とかなかったぞ、期待して損したぜ…","nextNodeIds":[711090614,711090615]},{"nodeId":711090614,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":421358722,"text":"確かに！","nextNodeIds":[711090617]},{"nodeId":711090617,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1662156178,"text":"でも、こんなところであんな綺麗な景色を見れたんだし…少なくとも無駄足じゃなかったかな？","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":711090615,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1838506098,"text":"気を落とさないで、料理を作ってあげる。","nextNodeIds":[711090616]},{"nodeId":711090616,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2685720306,"text":"#えっ！？本当にいいのか！{NICKNAME}、約束だぞ！","nextNodeIds":[711090617]},{"nodeId":711090612,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":894557770,"text":"#{M#俺}{F#私}も読めない…","nextNodeIds":[711090613]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7110906,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":44010023,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":4401,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["133115022","22001","2251.208:346.695:2188.656"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_GADGET"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[{"talkId":7110925,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRu