:"#あの{M#小僧}{F#小娘}を？一通り見て回り、干し肉の飯を作ってくれて？私が喜んだと？私がもう少し若ければ、兄者を殴り倒していますよ…","nextNodeIds":[711092505]},{"nodeId":711092505,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2484,"speakerName":"黄三","textMapHash":2093431994,"text":"たわけが！お前さんの掌法は、若い頃のわし以下だぞ！","nextNodeIds":[711092506]},{"nodeId":711092506,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2484,"speakerName":"黄三","textMapHash":3918199930,"text":"まぁよい。よく聞け…残るはわしら数人の老いぼれのみ。こう縁ある者の事情でも探らねば、本当に蔵書と共に棺桶に入ることになりかねんぞ。","nextNodeIds":[711092507]},{"nodeId":711092507,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2520,"speakerName":"文四","textMapHash":3856488498,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[711092508]},{"nodeId":711092508,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2484,"speakerName":"黄三","textMapHash":281088978,"text":"わはは！まぁ、縁起でもない話はこの辺りでやめておくか。","nextNodeIds":[711092509]},{"nodeId":711092509,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2484,"speakerName":"黄三","textMapHash":395178154,"text":"そうだ、先ほどあの子たちが作ってくれた飯をお前さんも食うてみろ。わはは、万民堂よりウマいぞ。ほら、一口どうだ！","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7110902,7110905,7110906,7110925],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","count":10},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":10},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2484,"speakerName":"黄三","count":6},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2233,"speakerName":"古い模刻","count":3},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2520,"speakerName":"文四","count":3},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2235,"speakerName":"碑銘","count":2},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2324,"speakerName":"古剣の銘文","count":2},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2234,"speakerName":"クネクネした模刻","count":2}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","BEGCMMJKCFC":[171109],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":2566793606,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_NONE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[